{"title":"Vanessa Rusczyk","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Vanessa Rusczyk is the wife of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Richard_Rusczyk\" title=\"Richard Rusczyk\">Richard Rusczyk</a>. She is an artist, and creates the cover art for many <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a> books. The logo of her <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.studiosoledad.com\">website</a> is a different coloring of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a>'s logo.\n</p><p>She was once a site <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Administrator\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Administrator\">Administrator</a>, with the username vRusczyk, but has been inactive on the community for a long time.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div class=\"noprint\" style=\"white-space: nowrap; float: right;\"></div>\n<table class=\"messagebox standard-talk\" id=\"wikipedianarticle\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><i>The subject of this article, <b>Vanessa Rusczyk</b>, has edited the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki\" title=\"AoPS Wiki\">AoPS Wiki</a> as <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:VRusczyk&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:VRusczyk (page does not exist)\">vRusczyk</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User_talk:VRusczyk&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User talk:VRusczyk (page does not exist)\">talk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:Contributions/vRusczyk\" title=\"Special:Contributions/vRusczyk\">contribs</a>).</i>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018113459\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 411/2097152 bytes\nTempla